## 1. Purpose

This license governs the use, reproduction, modification, distribution, publication, hosting, execution, training, indexing, adaptation, and commercialization of the VC4E ecosystem and all associated intellectual property.

The VC4E ecosystem includes, but is not limited to:

* Book manuscripts and chapter content
* Ebook editions
* Web-based engineering chapters
* HTML simulations
* Problem sets
* Prompt systems
* AI-assisted workflows
* Diagrams, graphics, and visual assets
* Source code and generated code
* YAML metadata structures
* GitHub repositories
* Submission systems
* Webflow content
* Cloudflare-hosted content
* Tally forms and submissions
* Educational frameworks and methodologies
* All derivative documentation and supporting materials

Unless otherwise stated in writing by the copyright holder, all such materials are proprietary.

