## 4. Prohibited Uses

Without prior written permission from Anil Bahuman, no person or entity may:

* Republish VC4E content in whole or substantial part
* Commercialize or resell VC4E materials
* Create derivative educational products based substantially on VC4E
* Use VC4E content for AI model training or dataset generation
* Mirror or scrape simulations, repositories, or chapters at scale
* Remove attribution, ownership notices, or metadata
* Redistribute proprietary prompts, workflows, or internal tooling
* Use VC4E branding or naming in misleading ways
* Host modified copies implying official affiliation
* Use student submissions outside officially authorized workflows

